e="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-500">Provider disputes connected to commerce, customer, and marketing context—with uncertainty shown explicitly.</p></div><div className="flex items-center gap-2"><Link href="/dashboard/chargebacks/exposure" className="rounded-lg border px-3 py-2 text-xs font-semibold">Exposure</Link><div className="rounded-full border px-3 py-1.5 text-xs text-slate-500">{s?`${s.liveTotal} Live · ${s.historicalTotal} Historical`:"Loading…"}</div></div></header>\n  <div className="grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4"><Metric name="Total disputes" value={String(s?.total??"—")} note="Live + historical"/><Metric name="Needs response" value={String(s?.statuses?.needs_response||0)}/><Metric name="Under review" value={String(s?.statuses?.under_review||0)}/><Metric name="Won / Lost" value={`${s?.statuses?.won||0} / ${s?.statuses?.lost||0}`}/></div>\n  <div className="rounded-xl border border-sky-200 bg-sky-50 p-3 text-xs text-sky-900">Dispute principal and provider-reported fees are shown per dispute. TraceKit does not present these as actual wallet loss or recovered dollars without authoritative wallet movements.</div>\n  {error&&<div className="rounded-xl border border-red-200 bg-red-50 p-4 text-sm text-red-800">{error}</div>}\n  <section className="overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border bg-white"><div className="border-b p-5"><h2 className="font-semibold">Dispute portfolio</h2><p className="text-xs text-slate-500">{data?`${data.pagination.returned} shown`:"Loading…"}</p></div><div className="overflow-x-auto"><table className="min-w-[850px] w-full text-left text-sm"><thead className="bg-slate-50 text-[10px] uppercase text-slate-500"><tr>{["Dispute","Status","Principal / fee","Reason","Match authority","Order"].map(h=><th key={h} className="px-4 py-3">{h}</th>)}</tr></thead><tbody className="divide-y">{data?.rows.map(r=><tr key={r.id} onClick={()=>setSelected(r)} className="cursor-pointer hover:bg-slate-50"><td className="px-4 py-3"><div>{date(r.disputeDate)}</d